ished on my old blog almost exactly a year ago. Since I really enjoy writin=
g (and reading) 'from scratch' articles, I wanted to modernize this article=
 for </span><em>Ahead of AI</em><span>.</span></p><p><span>Additionally, th=
is article motivated me to write the book </span><em><a href=3D"http://mng.=
bz/amjo">Build a Large Language Model (from Scratch)</a></em><span>, which =
